              "revision_30s": "Art 251-263 close Part XI: repugnancy rule (254, Union law prevails on Concurrent List unless state law got Presidential assent), administrative relations (256-261), Inter-State Council under Art 263 (constituted 1990 on Sarkaria's recommendation). Part XII (Art 264-300) = Finance: Consolidated Fund/Public Account (264-266), distribution of revenues, GST Council (279A, added by 101st Amdt 2016), Finance Commission every 5 years (280), borrowing powers (292-293), property/contracts/suits (298-300). Right to property downgraded from Fundamental Right to constitutional right at Art 300A by the 44th Amdt, 1978 — sits just past Art 300, in the next range technically, but closely tied to this Part. Genuine 'Services' provisions (UPSC/SPSC, All-India Services) are Part XIV, Art 308-323 — outside this block despite its label.",
