              "revision_30s": "Part XIII (301-307): free trade/commerce/intercourse, reasonable restrictions under 302-304 — Atiabari (1961) and Automobile Transport (1962) cases. Part XIV (308-323): Services — All-India Services under Art 312 (IAS/IPS/IFoS), UPSC/SPSC under 315-323 with independence safeguards (317). Part XV (324 onward): Election Commission and elections. Part XVI: special provisions for SC/ST/OBC/Anglo-Indians. Part XVII: Official Language. Part XVIII Emergency (352/356/360): National Emergency (352, grounds = war/external aggression/armed rebellion since 44th Amdt 1978, invoked 1962/1971/1975), President's Rule (356, curtailed by S.R. Bommai 1994), Financial Emergency (360, never invoked). Part XX: Amendment procedure (368), subject to Basic Structure doctrine (Kesavananda Bharati, 1973). Part XXI-XXII: temporary/transitional/miscellaneous and short title (Art 395 repeals the Govt of India Act 1935 and Indian Independence Act 1947).",
